752 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 520 0 R
/E (Connect2NGO is a comprehensive digital platform designed to bridge the gap between Non-)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
753 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 520 0 R
/E (Governmental Organizations \(NGOs\), donors, and volunteers through a unified, transparent, and technology-driven ecosystem. The system enhances trust and collaboration in the social sector by offering verified NGO profiles, secure donation management, and real-time impact tracking. The Project is developed using the Iterative SDLC model with a Java Spring Boot backend, MySQL database, and Thymeleaf-based responsive frontend, Connect2NGO integrates modular functionalities for NGOs, donors, volunteers, and administrators. NGOs can create campaigns, manage events, and share fund utilization reports, while donors and volunteers can discover causes, make secure contributions, and participate in verified programs. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
754 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 520 0 R
/E (The platform is developed using the Iterative SDLC model with a Java Spring Boot backend, MySQL database, and Thymeleaf-based responsive frontend. This modular design ensures scalability, security, and smooth integration of different user roles. Role-based access control and JWT-based authentication safeguard user data and maintain system integrity, ensuring transparency across all interactions. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
755 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 520 0 R
/E (Emphasizing transparency and accountability, the platform provides role-based access control, data integrity through JWT-based authentication, and fund-tracking features that strengthen donor confidence. Testing results confirm its scalability, usability, and efficiency, achieving high satisfaction among users for navigation, responsiveness, and information clarity. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
756 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 520 0 R
/E (In conclusion, Connect2NGO successfully demonstrates how digital transformation can empower social good by fostering trust, efficiency, and inclusivity within the NGO ecosystem, setting the stage for future enhancements such as AI-driven recommendations and blockchain-enabled donation traceability. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
