/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 525 0 R
/E (One of the fundamental challenges lies in the lack of a unified communication channel that can seamlessly connect NGOs with potential donors and volunteers. While the intent to contribute to social causes is widespread, many individuals and organizations hesitate to donate due to the absence of accountability and transparency in fund management. Similarly, volunteers often find it difficult to identify credible NGOs or discover initiatives that align with their interests or location. These gaps weaken public trust and reduce participation, resulting in lower fundraising outcomes and underutilized volunteer potential. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
