/P 564 0 R
/E (The development of Connect2NGO represents a major step toward bridging the communication and transparency gap between NGOs, donors, and volunteers. Through the effective integration of technology, the platform successfully demonstrates how social impact initiatives can be managed and monitored digitally with accountability. )
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
