1367 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 564 0 R
/E (Throughout the project, emphasis was placed on trust, usability, and automation. By introducing features such as verified NGO profiles, real-time fund utilization tracking, secure donation channels, and auto-generated certificates, Connect2NGO fosters both credibility and convenience. The use of Spring Boot with JWT authentication ensures data protection, while the modular database design provides flexibility for future growth. )
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1368 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 564 0 R
/E (Testing outcomes validate the success of the platform. The application consistently delivered reliable performance, with minimal errors and excellent user feedback. The low latency and high transaction success rate indicate that the architecture can support a growing user base without compromising speed or security. )
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1369 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 564 0 R
/E (More importantly, Connect2NGO demonstrates how a well-designed digital platform can create social value through technology. It empowers NGOs with tools for better visibility, offers donors measurable accountability, and gives volunteers opportunities for verified participation. As the nonprofit sector continues to digitalize, systems like Connect2NGO can become foundational in promoting ethical, data-driven philanthropy. )
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
