/T (  Abstract: This paper presents Connect2NGO, a comprehensive digital platform designed to bridge the gap between Non- Governmental Organizations \(NGOs\), donors, and volunteers through a unified, transparent, and technology-driven ecosystem. The Indian NGO landscape often struggles with fragmented communication, low visibility, and a lack of donor trust. Connect2NGO addresses these challenges by creating an integrated environment that enhances transparency, accountability, and collaboration within the social sector. )
/E (  Abstract: This paper presents Connect2NGO, a comprehensive digital platform designed to bridge the gap between Non- Governmental Organizations \(NGOs\), donors, and volunteers through a unified, transparent, and technology-driven ecosystem. The Indian NGO landscape often struggles with fragmented communication, low visibility, and a lack of donor trust. Connect2NGO addresses these challenges by creating an integrated environment that enhances transparency, accountability, and collaboration within the social sector. )
/Pg 75 0 R
/K [23]
>>
