/E (Thethird major theme emerging from theliterature concerns the disconnection between donors, volunteers, and NGOs. Several research works emphasize the pressing need for a centralized digital platform that can effectively connect contributors with recipients and facilitate smooth resource exchange [6]. The absence of such unified systems often leads to fragmented outreach efforts and duplication of initiatives, thereby limiting the overall societal impact. )
/Pg 76 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
