/E (Recent studies highlight the growing acceptance and necessity of digital platforms to support NGO operations, streamline administrative workflows, and enhance volunteer management processes [1], [4], [5]. These platforms are shown to significantly reduce operational overhead by automating repetitive tasks such as donor record maintenance, event scheduling, and volunteer coordination. Researchers also underscore that integrating digital tools helps NGOs maintain accurate data repositories, improve communication with stakeholders, and increase overall efficiency. )
/Pg 76 0 R
/K [14]
