/E (The development of Connect2NGO is grounded in an in-depth review of contemporary research on digital transformation in the non-profit sector. The literature emphasizes the increasing importance of information technology in strengthening NGO operations, improving transparency, and fostering trust among stakeholders. Three major thematic domains have been identified as directly influencing the conceptualization and design of Connect2NGO: Digital Platforms for NGO Management and Volunteering, Transparency and Traceability in Donations, and Bridging the Gap Between Donors and Recipients. )
/Pg 76 0 R
/K [25]
