/Title (In addition to transparency and usability, Connect2NGO prioritizes data integrity and accountability. Every donation, event registration, or profile update is logged systematically within the database, allowing for reliable audit trails. The system architecture has been intentionally designed to accommodate future integrations such as AI-based NGO recommendations and blockchain-powered fund traceability, which can make donation processes even more secure and tamper-proof. In a sector where credibility determines survival, such mechanisms offer an unmatched advantage.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
